  "research_question": "To investigate whether the gradient of texture-density in a retinal image determines the perception of optical slant of a visual surface, in isolation from other depth cues.",
  "design_type": "within_subjects",
  "participants": {
    "n": 10,
    "description": "10 paid observers (9 women: 3 students, 3 clerical workers, 3 psychology teachers; 1 man: engineer) for the main experiment. A substantiation experiment used 32 different observers.",
